//* TO SOLVE THIS CHALLENGE, NO CHANGE NEEDED TO COBOL, AND
//* CONCENTRATE ON UNDERSTANDING THE LINK BETWEEN:
//* +  COBOL FILE-CONTROL ASSIGN NAME (PROGRAM INTERNAL NAME)
